Package: kulan-installer
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: @PUBLISHER@ <@MAINTAINER_EMAIL@>
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Depends: python3 (>= 3.11), python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1 (>= 1.5), pkexec | policykit-1, util-linux, fdisk, parted, dosfstools, e2fsprogs, cryptsetup, squashfs-tools (>= 1:4.5), udev
Recommends: kulan-desktop-settings
Homepage: @HOME_URL@
Description: @NAME@ installer
 Installs @NAME@ in a few steps: language, keyboard, disk, time zone and
 account. It can erase a disk or install next to Windows, with optional
 encryption, and needs no internet connection.
 .
 Runs from the live USB stick and isn't kept on the installed system.
 Calamares is still available as Advanced install.
